 *   **When to use**: Suitable for volumes with large empty regions that can be defined by exclusion planes, or when a specific layered approximation is desired for performance [S1, unofficial].
-*   **When not to use**: For volumes requiring high accuracy without gaps, or when the volume data is not well-aligned with the view direction and exclusion planes are not effective [S1, unofficial].
